    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      446.65,
      539.9,
      469.72
    ],
    "text": "This Order shall be valid for a period of 06 months commencing from November 01, 2017, subject to provisionsof Sub Section (3) of Section 2 of the Special Commodity Levy Act, No. 48 of 2007.",
